  "text": "Ghrazi Blood Knights Solo 100% Ranged-Melee Hybrid  \n\n​\nIntroduction\nThis is an advanced guide which assumes a strong underlying knowledge of all mechanics and information presented in #unknown-channel.\n​\nPositioning\n\n⬥ Starting from the tile you spawn on when you enter the instance, use  +  to reach the tile marked above.\n⬥ You can use this Tilemarkers plugin preset to display the correct tiles ingame:\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• After  +  to tile marked as 1 → walk to 2 → then 3 → then 4\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• TM2IQRHQktzCsDn_g8NDAUBCq0FDEmbCgLIZP__oFDMjAwUpRUV_4QREYwMFAADAwADAAADAAABNAEzATIBMQ​\n​\nPreset Suggestions\n⬥ Ranged-Melee Preset Example\n​\nRotations\n⬥  both of them throughout the fight\n​\nWar's Retreat\n  →  →  → s  \n​\nPhase 1-3\n +  to tile marked as 1 + r  +  →   →   →  +   →   →  →   →   →   →  →  →  → \n​\nTumours\n\n\n​\nHeart\n → s →  →  →  →  →  → s → r +  →  →  → \n​\nPhase 4-5\n +  →  →   →   →  →    →  →   →  +    →  →   →   →   → \n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ 1:19.8\n\n\n​\n      \n    ",
